{"type": "result", "subtype": "success", "is_error": false, "duration_ms": 988404, "duration_api_ms": 950565, "num_turns": 28, "result": "Review 完成。加权总分 **6.3/10**，最终建议 **Weak Accept（边界）**。\n\n核心结论：论文首次系统揭示 5–20 Hz 低频不可听信号对 6 个主流 LALM 的广泛安全风险，问题真实、评测独立、新颖性成立。主要缺口在于因果机制分析不完整（作者自述）、Sentence Attention Scale Estimation 相对简单 VAD 的增量价值未证明、代码未开源、2/6 模型依赖闭源 API。建议补充消融实验和机制隔离后接收。", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "session_id": "514cf847-e2b2-4f3b-8d8a-d0cda909415c", "total_cost_usd": 2.99991, "usage": {"input_tokens": 566002, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 6796, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "", "iterations": [], "speed": "standard"}, "modelUsage": {"GLM-5.2-w4a8": {"inputTokens": 566002, "outputTokens": 6796, "cacheReadInputTokens": 0, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 0, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 2.99991, "contextWindow": 200000, "maxOutputTokens": 32000}}, "permission_denials": [], "fast_mode_state": "off", "uuid": "c8731aa4-760a-4cbb-88ba-a1448cea0fd1"}
